# Vercel CLI deploys are run from the repository root and pick the project's
# Root Directory (apps/api or apps/web) from its settings. Keep local secrets
# and build artefacts out of the upload.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/.wrangler
**/.vercel
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
apps/mobile/build
apps/mobile/.dart_tool
apps/mobile/ios/Pods
